  "prefLabel": "Soil 304.03 Authorization to Practice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 304.03 Authorization to Practice. An applicant for soil scientist or wetland scientist apprentice, who has met all requirements of Soil 301.01(a) and has been approved by the OPLC shall be issued an authorization to practice as an apprentice.\n\nSource. #14019, eff 9-6-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Soil 300)",
